# Sales Data Analysis Report

## Project Overview

This project analyzes a sales dataset using Python and the pandas library. The program loads the sales data from a CSV file, cleans the dataset by handling missing values and duplicate records, calculates important sales metrics, and generates a formatted report.

---

## Objectives

- Learn how to use pandas.
- Load a CSV file.
- Handle missing values.
- Remove duplicate records.
- Calculate important sales metrics.
- Generate a formatted report.

---

## Technologies Used

- Python 3
- pandas

